    "\\mathbf{p}(t) = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0 \\end{bmatrix} + t \\cdot \\begin{bmatrix} 2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3 \\end{bmatrix}\n",
    "= \\begin{bmatrix} 1 + 2t \\\\ 2 - t \\\\ 3t \\end{bmatrix}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Intuisi:\n",
    "\n",
    "* *$\\mathbf{p}(0) = \\mathbf{p}_0$* → titik awal garis.\n",
    "* *$\\mathbf{p}(1) = \\mathbf{p}_0 + \\mathbf{d}$* → maju sejauh satu kali vektor arah.\n",
    "* *$\\mathbf{p}(-1) = \\mathbf{p}_0 - \\mathbf{d}$* → mundur sejauh satu kali vektor arah.\n",
