   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 1.1.4.4 Intersection of a Plane and a Line"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ef76d9e8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Untuk mencari titik potong antara sebuah bidang dan garis, kita dapat mensubstitusikan persamaan garis ke dalam persamaan bidang, lalu menyelesaikan nilai parameter pada garis (biasanya disimbolkan sebagai t) yang memenuhi persamaan bidang tersebut.\n",
    "\n",
    "Langkahnya:\n",
    "* Persamaan bidang dalam bentuk:\n",
    "$$ax+by+cz+d=0$$\n",
    "* Persamaan garis dalam bentuk vektor:\n",
    "$$p(t)=p_0+t\\cdot d$$\n",
    "* Substitusi koordinat garis \n",
    "𝑝(𝑡) ke dalam persamaan bidang:\n",
    "$$a(x_0+td_x)+b(y_0+td_y)+c(z_0+td_z)+d=0$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "44998836",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "FIGURE 1.11"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 27,
   "id": "7cc5219f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 1000x700 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "from mpl_toolkits.mplot3d import Axes3D\n",
    "\n",
    "# Titik pada bidang dan garis\n",
    "p1 = np.array([2, -1, 0])   # Titik pada bidang\n",
    "n = np.array([1, 1, 5])     # Vektor normal bidang\n",
    "\n",
    "p2 = np.array([1, 0, 2])    # Titik pada garis\n",
    "d = np.array([-1, 1, -2])   # Vektor arah garis\n",
    "\n",
    "# Hitung parameter t\n",
    "t = np.dot(n, p1 - p2) / np.dot(n, d)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Titik potong\n",
    "p_intersect = p2 + t * d\n",
    "\n",
    "# Buat grid bidang\n",
    "xx, yy = np.meshgrid(np.linspace(-2, 4, 10), np.linspace(-3, 3, 10))\n",
    "zz = (5 - xx - yy) / 5  # Dari persamaan bidang: x + y + 5z = 5\n",
    "\n",
    "# Gambar\n",
    "fig = plt.figure(figsize=(10, 7))\n",
    "ax = fig.add_subplot(111, projection='3d')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Plot bidang\n",
    "ax.plot_surface(xx, yy, zz, alpha=0.4, color='orange', label='Plane')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Plot garis\n",
    "t_vals = np.linspace(-1, 2, 10)\n",
    "line = p2.reshape(3,1) + d.reshape(3,1) * t_vals\n",
    "ax.plot(line[0], line[1], line[2], 'b-', label='Line')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Plot titik-titik\n",
    "ax.scatter(*p1, color='green', s=60, label='Point on Plane (p1)')\n",
    "ax.scatter(*p2, color='purple', s=60, label='Point on Line (p2)')\n",
    "ax.scatter(*p_intersect, color='red', s=80, label='Intersection Point')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Tampilan\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel('x')\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel('y')\n",
    "ax.set_zlabel('z')\n",
    "ax.set_title('Figure 1.11 – Intersection of a Plane and a Line')\n",
    "ax.legend()\n",
    "ax.view_init(elev=20, azim=30)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d5790bf7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Untuk mencari titik potong antara sebuah bidang (plane) dan garis (line), kita gunakan:\n",
    "\n",
    "### 🔹 *Persamaan bidang* (plane equation):\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\vec{n} \\cdot (\\vec{p} - \\vec{p}_1) = 0\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "dengan:\n",
    "\n",
    "* $\\vec{n} = [a, b, c]^T$ adalah *vektor normal* bidang,\n",
    "* $\\vec{p}_1$ adalah titik pada bidang.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 🔹 *Persamaan garis* (line equation):\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\vec{p}(t) = \\vec{p}_2 + t \\vec{d}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "dengan:\n",
    "\n",
    "* $\\vec{d}$ adalah vektor arah garis,\n",
    "* $\\vec{p}_2$ adalah titik pada garis,\n",
    "* $t$ adalah parameter skalar.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 🔹 *Langkah mencari titik potong*:\n",
    "\n",
    "Substitusi persamaan garis ke persamaan bidang:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "t = \\frac{\\vec{n} \\cdot (\\vec{p}_1 - \\vec{p}_2)}{\\vec{n} \\cdot \\vec{d}}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "dan\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\vec{p}_\\text{intersect} = \\vec{p}_2 + t \\vec{d}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Hasil:\n",
    "\n",
    "Visualisasi akan menunjukkan:\n",
    "\n",
    "* *Bidang* (transparan oranye),\n",
    "* *Garis* (biru) yang memotong bidang,\n",
    "* *Titik potong* (merah) yang dihitung dari persamaan.\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
