    "### *Deskripsi Visual*\n",
    "\n",
    "* Sistem koordinat Kartesian 3D menggunakan *tiga sumbu utama*:\n",
    "\n",
    "  * $x$-axis → arah *kanan*\n",
    "  * $y$-axis → arah *maju/mendatar*\n",
    "  * $z$-axis → arah *atas*\n",
    "* Ketiga sumbu ini saling tegak lurus satu sama lain (*orthogonal*).\n",
    "* Pada gambar:\n",
    "\n",
    "  * Vektor satuan ditandai sebagai $\\vec{u}_x, \\vec{u}_y, \\vec{u}_z$\n",
    "  * Titik $P_1$ memiliki koordinat $(x_1, y_1, z_1)$\n",
    "  * Vektor posisi dari titik asal $O$ ke $P_1$ adalah $\\vec{p}_1$\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "### *Notasi Vektor Posisi*\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\vec{p}_1 = \\overrightarrow{OP_1} = x_1 \\vec{u}_x + y_1 \\vec{u}_y + z_1 \\vec{u}_z\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Atau dalam bentuk matriks kolom:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\vec{p}_1 = \n",
    "\\begin{bmatrix}\n",
    "x_1 \\\\\n",
    "y_1 \\\\\n",
    "z_1\n",
    "\\end{bmatrix}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "### *Aturan Cross Product Vektor Satuan*\n",
    "\n",
    "Dalam sistem koordinat kartesian ortonormal, berlaku:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\vec{u}_x \\times \\vec{u}_y = \\vec{u}_z \\\\\n",
    "\\vec{u}_y \\times \\vec{u}_z = \\vec{u}_x \\\\\n",
    "\\vec{u}_z \\times \\vec{u}_x = \\vec{u}_y\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Sebaliknya (jika dibalik urutannya), arah vektor hasil akan terbalik (negatif):\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\vec{u}_y \\times \\vec{u}_x = -\\vec{u}_z\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
