   "source": [
    "## *Tujuan Figure 1.14.3:*\n",
    "\n",
    "Menunjukkan bagaimana sistem koordinat bola (spherical coordinate system) bekerja, termasuk:\n",
    "\n",
    "* Posisi suatu titik dalam ruang 3D\n",
    "* Basis vektor satuan dalam sistem bola: $\\vec{u}r, \\vec{u}\\theta, \\vec{u}_\\phi$\n",
    "* Konversi dari sistem bola ke kartesian (dan sebaliknya)\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## *Koordinat Bola (Spherical Coordinates)*\n",
    "\n",
    "Titik $P$ dalam ruang dapat dinyatakan sebagai:\n",
    "\n",
    "* $r$ = *jarak* dari titik ke pusat koordinat (panjang vektor posisi)\n",
    "* $\\theta$ = *zenith angle*, yaitu sudut antara vektor posisi dan sumbu-z\n",
    "* $\\phi$ = *azimuth angle*, yaitu sudut antara proyeksi titik pada bidang $xy$ dengan sumbu-x\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## *Konversi ke Cartesian:*\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\begin{aligned}\n",
    "x &= r \\sin\\theta \\cos\\phi \\\\\n",
    "y &= r \\sin\\theta \\sin\\phi \\\\\n",
    "z &= r \\cos\\theta\n",
    "\\end{aligned}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## *Konversi dari Cartesian ke Spherical:*\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\begin{aligned}\n",
    "r &= \\sqrt{x^2 + y^2 + z^2} \\\\\n",
    "\\theta &= \\tan^{-1}\\left( \\frac{\\sqrt{x^2 + y^2}}{z} \\right) \\\\\n",
    "\\phi &= \\tan^{-1}\\left( \\frac{y}{x} \\right)\n",
    "\\end{aligned}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## *Basis Vektor Satuan dalam Sistem Bola:*\n",
    "\n",
    "Basis vektor satuan dalam koordinat bola berubah tergantung posisi (tidak tetap seperti $\\vec{u}_x, \\vec{u}_y, \\vec{u}_z$):\n",
    "\n",
    "### (a) Vektor posisi $\\vec{u}_r$\n",
    "\n",
    "Arah: *keluar dari pusat ke titik P*\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\vec{u}_r = \\sin\\theta\\cos\\phi\\,\\vec{u}_x + \\sin\\theta\\sin\\phi\\,\\vec{u}_y + \\cos\\theta\\,\\vec{u}_z\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### (b) Vektor $\\vec{u}_\\theta$\n",
    "\n",
    "Arah: *menurun dari titik P ke arah sumbu z* (berkaitan dengan perubahan sudut $\\theta$)\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\vec{u}_\\theta = \\cos\\theta\\cos\\phi\\,\\vec{u}_x + \\cos\\theta\\sin\\phi\\,\\vec{u}_y - \\sin\\theta\\,\\vec{u}_z\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### (c) Vektor $\\vec{u}_\\phi$\n",
    "\n",
    "Arah: *melingkar di sekitar sumbu-z* (perubahan azimuth $\\phi$)\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\vec{u}_\\phi = -\\sin\\phi\\,\\vec{u}_x + \\cos\\phi\\,\\vec{u}_y\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## *Penjelasan Visual Gambar:*\n",
    "\n",
    "* Titik $P$ ditampilkan di ruang 3D.\n",
    "* $\\vec{u}_r$: panah merah dari pusat ke $P$.\n",
    "* $\\vec{u}_\\theta$: panah hijau dari $P$ ke bawah (arah perubahan $\\theta$).\n",
    "* $\\vec{u}_\\phi$: panah biru membentuk arah melingkar di sekitar sumbu-z (searah tangan kanan).\n",
    "* Panah-panah basis kartesian $\\vec{u}_x, \\vec{u}_y, \\vec{u}_z$ juga ditampilkan sebagai acuan arah tetap.\n",
    "* Gambar dibagi 3 bagian:\n",
    "\n",
    "  * *(a)* Menjelaskan arah $\\vec{u}_r$\n",
    "  * *(b)* Menjelaskan arah $\\vec{u}_\\theta$\n",
    "  * *(c)* Menjelaskan arah $\\vec{u}_\\phi$\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
