    "## Penjelasan Visual Figure 1.16 (Projection of a Point onto a Plane)\n",
    "\n",
    "### Konsep Matematika\n",
    "\n",
    "Misalkan:\n",
    "\n",
    "* Sebuah *titik $\\mathbf{p}_1 \\in \\mathbb{R}^3$* terletak *di luar bidang*.\n",
    "* Sebuah *bidang* didefinisikan oleh:\n",
    "\n",
    "  $$\n",
    "  ax + by + cz + d = 0 \\tag{1.1.12}\n",
    "  $$\n",
    "* Dengan *vektor normal* $\\mathbf{n} = [a, b, c]^T$\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "### Tujuan:\n",
    "\n",
    "Menentukan *proyeksi ortogonal* dari $\\mathbf{p}_1$ ke bidang, yaitu titik $\\mathbf{p}_2$, dengan:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\mathbf{p}{21} = \\text{proj}{\\mathbf{n}}(\\mathbf{p}_0 - \\mathbf{p}_1) = \\left( \\frac{(\\mathbf{p}_0 - \\mathbf{p}_1) \\cdot \\mathbf{n}}{\\|\\mathbf{n}\\|^2} \\right) \\mathbf{n}\n",
    "\\tag{1.1.15}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\mathbf{p}2 = \\mathbf{p}_1 + \\mathbf{p}{21}\n",
    "\\tag{1.1.16}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
