    "| *$\\mathbf{p}_{01}$*  | oranye → | Vektor dari $p_1$ ke $p_0$                 |\n",
    "| *$\\mathbf{p}_{21}$*  | ungu →   | Proyeksi $\\mathbf{p}_{01}$ ke $\\mathbf{n}$ |\n",
    "| *$\\hat{\\mathbf{n}}$* | hitam →  | Vektor normal bidang                       |\n"
